{"id":"n2-175","title":"～上で (〜ue de)","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Used to express that something is done after or on the basis of something else; 'after', 'upon'.","longExplanation":"The ～上で grammar point is used to indicate that an action or decision is made after another action or condition, or based on certain information. It can be translated as 'after doing something' or 'on the basis of...'.","formation":"Verb-ますstem + 上で, Noun + の上で","examples":[{"jp":"調査を行った上で、結論を出しましょう。","romaji":"Chousa wo okonatta ue de, ketsuron wo dashimashou.","en":"Let's draw a conclusion after conducting the investigation.","words":[{"surface":"調査","vocabId":"1429120","reading":"ちょうさ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行っ","vocabId":"1589060","reading":"おこなう","baseForm":"行う"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"上","vocabId":"1352130","reading":"うえ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"結論","vocabId":"1255020","reading":"けつろん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"出し","vocabId":"1339160","reading":"だし","baseForm":"出す"},{"surface":"ましょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5]},{"jp":"就職活動を終えた上で、進学するかどうか決めます。","romaji":"Shuushoku katsudou wo oeta ue de, shingaku suru ka dou ka kimemasu.","en":"I will decide whether to continue my studies after finishing my job hunting.","words":[{"surface":"就職","vocabId":"1331670","reading":"しゅうしょく"},{"surface":"活動","vocabId":"1208360","reading":"かつどう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"終え","vocabId":"1332760","reading":"おえる","baseForm":"終える"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"上","vocabId":"1352130","reading":"うえ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"進学","vocabId":"1366010","reading":"しんがく"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null}